OL,3,GNEWSALive facial recognition to be
OL,4,Aintroduced in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Stuart King, the force's
OL,7,Foperational lead for LFR, said the
OL,8,Ftactic would only be used when it was
OL,9,F"lawful, necessary and proportionate to
OL,10,Fdo so".
